flowchart TB
  contract[packages/contract library]

  subgraph development [Development, three processes]
    staffDev[Staff browser]
    web[Web server apps/web :5173]
    internalDev[Internal API apps/server :4000]
    externalDev[External API apps/mock-api :3010]
    staffDev -->|loads the form| web
    web -->|POST /v1/quotes| internalDev
    internalDev -->|POST /v1/quotes plus api-key| externalDev
  end

  subgraph production [Production, two processes]
    staffProd[Staff browser]
    internalProd["Web server and internal API apps/server :4443"]
    externalProd[External API apps/mock-api :3443]
    staffProd -->|loads the form and POST /v1/quotes| internalProd
    internalProd -->|POST /v1/quotes plus api-key| externalProd
  end

  web -.->|imports schemas| contract
  internalDev -.->|imports schemas| contract
  externalDev -.->|imports schemas| contract
  internalProd -.->|imports schemas| contract
  externalProd -.->|imports schemas| contract
